      {
        "id": "948912153010765824",
        "images": [],
        "links": [],
        "text": "[\n3:58 AM\n]\nThursday, March 3, 2022 at 3:58 AM\nIf they changed it, it’s probably to remove the bug in Ghost Valley tracks where you could low trick from ledges in Ghost Valley to slip under the floor",
